[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5056.39, "timestamp": "01:24:16", "text": "快点，我们得找辆车或交通工具之类的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5059.87, "timestamp": "01:24:19", "text": "这样对我们来说就容易多了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5063.15, "timestamp": "01:24:23", "text": "跑啊，我什么也没看见。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5065.189, "timestamp": "01:24:25", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5066.31, "timestamp": "01:24:26", "text": "你有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5072.99, "timestamp": "01:24:32", "text": "治愈，快来，快来，快来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5080.669, "timestamp": "01:24:40", "text": "你又要死了吗？是的，我不不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5084.75, "timestamp": "01:24:44", "text": "不，是的，我没事，你做到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5088.149, "timestamp": "01:24:48", "text": "不错，但我快要死了 20 20 马力 我的天哪"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5090.99, "timestamp": "01:24:50", "text": "上帝啊，没事了，我已经痊愈了，我足够了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5094.149, "timestamp": "01:24:54", "text": "恢复过来，我们只需要进入状态"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5098.79, "timestamp": "01:24:58", "text": "那是直接冲进区域跑动"}]